WEBVTT

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.350
Good morning!

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.330
Please patiently come, remember, no running!

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:25.040
Showdown!

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.810
Dorothy, I love how you try so hard!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.790
Solami Smile, don't lose!

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.010
Lala-chan give it your all!

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:41.480
Lala!

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.260
I'll always support you!

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.410
Thanks!

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.610
Do your best everyone-garu!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.200
I'll prepare a spell from hell-dearu!

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.940
I'll be cheering with all my heart-nano!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.730
Get fired up for the final!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.690
Is a final delicious? What kind of food is it?

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.960
You don't eat it, Pepper.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:04.630
Onee-chan, fight!

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.120
Solami Smile and Dressing Pafe

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.440
I'm supporting you both!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.170
Thank you!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.640
Sophie-sama!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.130
Today is the final day of sumo!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.770
Go for the victory mark-chanko!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.320
Victory or nothing!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.550
Smash your way to victory!

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:27.930
Both teams, don't hold back and leave no regrets behind-glo!

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.020
Lala, break a leg!

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.790
I love you Dorothy!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.140
Here we go!

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:10.070
Everyone, it's finally time!

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:13.940
The Divine Idol Grand Prix final is here!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.910
Now, a few words from the Goddesses.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.510
It's been a long road to come this far,

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:30.100
each team to have made it is a sparkling jewel.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:34.390
And because of that, I'm sure that today's final will be amazing!

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:36.210
Jululu...

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.520
I respect the teams that have made it so far,

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.960
with the goal of becoming a Divine Idol in their hearts, both teams

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.540
don't let up and give it your all in the final.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.610
I'm so excited!

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:58.900
It's finally here, a chance to achieve what nobody since Saints has...

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:04.360
Divine Idol, a rank that everyone longs to be.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.720
Will it be Solami Smile,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.020
or Dressing Pafe?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:15.110
People from around the world, wait in anticipation to see the results.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.280
They have gathered to see if either team's performance,

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:26.870
will unlock the long-awaited Divine Dress and Divine Heels.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.460
We're up first-pri.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.520
And we're second.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.830
Oh well,

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.610
we'll let you play, before we paste you.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:44.780
Dorothy...

