00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.080
Making Drama, switch on!

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:43.460
Super Cyalume Change!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.310
Sophie-sama is so cool!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:29.010
Mirei, you're so cute!

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.410
Lala-chan too!

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.250
Solami are the best!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.460
