00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.480
Jululu!

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:26.630
Solami Smile, congratulations on winning the tournament!

00:21:27.610 --> 00:21:30.510
Defeating many opponents on this long road,

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.370
